 "body": {
  "text": "GM QUARTERLY BONUS: 4% of gym quarterly EBITDA above target, paid within 60 days of quarter end, subject to true-up: any overpayment arising from a later correction of gym EBITDA is offset against the next quarterly bonus (no ad-hoc payroll deduction). SALES COMMISSION: 8% of first-year contract value on new and amended corporate wellness contracts, paid in the month following signature; overpayments are offset against future commissions. Q1 2026 gym EBITDA targets: Oakland $380,000; San Jose $280,000; Sacramento $310,000; Fresno $340,000; Santa Cruz $240,000; Berkeley $310,000.",
